Coordinate with Legal Research Analysts, Attorneys, and Staff to provide reference, research and support in a timely and efficient manner. Where applicable, provides in-depth analysis and summarization of results. Bills time to client/matters as appropriate;
Work with lawyers to advise on optimal strategy and source selection to obtain the most authoritative and cost-effective research results;
Collaborate with lawyers, staff, and clients to perform in-depth legal, corporate, financial and/or general research by utilizing the appropriate mix of the firm's wide range of external and internal legal, business, and news resources;
Partner as necessary with other members of the Practice Innovation & Legal Solutions Department on projects and with the firm's other departments and teams;
Assist in the dissemination and organization of information obtained in print and electronic resources/databases;
Share research findings clearly and concisely;
Help monitor daily news, legislative and regulatory developments as required;
Support research training for attorneys and staff and assist in the development of new research and reference offerings;
Keep department leadership informed of the latest research resources, technologies and search techniques, including potential additions and/or enhancements to research services;
Participate in team initiatives to promote research resources, tools, and services;
Work beyond scheduled hours as required; and
Handle additional related projects as assigned.

cond_0262.responsibilities:
